WEBVTT

00:00:04.951 --> 00:00:10.520
<v><b>Paula:</b></v> Hey, whassup everyone. I’m Paula, and this is my house.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:21.461
Hey, this is the living room where I relax and watch TV.

00:00:30.752 --> 00:00:31.381
What?

00:00:31.887 --> 00:00:37.841
This is the dining room where I have lunch and dinner with my family.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.816
Hey, this is my study where I work all day.

00:00:52.747 --> 00:00:56.915
Hey! This is the bathroom where I take showers. Get out.

00:00:57.662 --> 00:01:01.661
And this is my bedroom where I sleep.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:13.626
And this is the kitchen where I cook delicious recipes. See you.